            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Allrecipes Member"
            },
            "reviewBody": "please dont make this...there are much better pumpkin bread recipes on this site...but if you do not heed my warning and decide to make it...please at least add a teaspoon or so each of cinnamon, ginger, or nutmeg, and possibly cloves and vanilla. w/o these this bread will be very bland.",
